    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thank you all for playing my game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>This game has undergone extensive testing with demos and friends, and has now been officially released!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>At present, this game has a total of 50 hours of gameplay experience, and the volume is very large!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614570/extras/7c77eff933016f31d101aad00d5d9350.avif?t=1751638335\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There is one thing I must apologize for:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Because English is not my native language, I can only rely on machines to translate the English version as much as possible</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I am very sorry that the translated content may be a bit strange!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the future, I will seek formal and professional translation assistance!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hope everyone understands!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the ancient Yellowstone continent, a magic with corrupt energy slowly erodes here, and the creatures touched become extremely cruel. However, intelligent creatures increasingly crave the additional power brought by this energy ..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist seems to be a &quot;destined person&quot; guided by fate, slowly uncovering the truth of the dark magic of this continent under the guidance of angels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, things are not that simple, and the so-called justice on this continent is far from it. Conspiracy has gradually surfaced with the investigation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614570/extras/d66dfe78bd6d6d91b35316f72e36795b.avif?t=1751638335\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a very traditional turn based game, where the vast majority of elements in turn based games are included</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a linear storyline without any decryption elements, ensuring that players can enjoy the game all the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a very rich system of props and equipment, including up to 110 dynamic enemies and 80 dynamic bosses with dragon bones, and players can control more than 30 character images</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has undergone testing and feedback from over 300 players, and is now guaranteed to have almost no bugs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a set system, inlay system, enchantment system, crafting system, synthesis system, skill learning system, and encyclopedia collection system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game allows you to choose 6 professions from 32 to form your team, emphasizing the combination of professions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure that each save has a different gaming experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the above gameplay, it also includes farm, ranch and other gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At present, the game duration can reach up to 50 hours. If you like to play games of the brush brush type, then you will definitely love this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614570/extras/aedf36a8406c917590069a8990a6f5a3.poster.avif?t=1751638335\" width=640 height=360 ><sour